# GitHub Pages links (kiwi-ai-study)

Production is a **GitHub project site**: `https://libincai.github.io/kiwi-ai-study/<slug>`.  
Local dev simulates this with `serve.json` + `tools/kiwi_dev_server.py` — **do not assume what works on localhost works on GitHub without stubs and site-base.**

## Two different mechanisms

| Environment | Clean URL `/grade-3` served by |
|-------------|------------------------------|
| Local (`kiwi_dev_server.py`) | `serve.json` rewrites / redirects |
| GitHub Pages | `{slug}/index.html` stub at repo root (from `tools/generate_github_pages_stubs.py`) |

After any new public slug: run `python tools/generate-serve-rewrites.py` and **commit the new/updated stub folder**.

## Root-absolute `href` (`/math`, `/grade-9`, `/foundation-foo`)

Pages use clean paths on purpose. On GitHub they must become `/kiwi-ai-study/...` — that is **`assets/js/kiwi-site-base.js`** (sets `KIWI_SITE_BASE`, patches links, exposes `kiwiRootHref`).

**Every public HTML page that has root-absolute links or `drive-breadcrumb.js` must load site-base in `<head>`** (non-defer), before breadcrumb/search scripts:

```html
<script src="../assets/js/kiwi-site-base.js?v=…"></script>
```

When editing **generators** (`local/kiwi_math_catalog.py`, `templates/*.html`), add site-base to the shared header — never hand-write hub pages without it.

`drive-breadcrumb.js` builds URLs with `kiwiRootHref`; without site-base, breadcrumbs point at `libincai.github.io/math` (wrong).

## Href conventions

- **Cross-section / grade / course / topic slugs:** `href="/<slug>"` (let site-base prefix on GitHub).
- **Same-folder assets:** `../assets/...`, `../about/index.html` — relative is fine.
- Do not add new `href="/math/foo"` patterns without site-base on that page.
- Register new pages in `assets/js/drive-breadcrumb.js` when breadcrumbs should show.

## Agent checklist (before saying “done”)

1. New slug → rewrites + **GitHub stub** committed.
2. Page or catalog template includes **`kiwi-site-base.js`** if it uses `/…` links or breadcrumb.
3. Run **`python tools/check_site_links.py`** (also runs from `tools/dev-server.ps1`) — must exit 0.
4. Mental check: would `libincai.github.io` + href land **outside** `/kiwi-ai-study/`? If yes, fix.

## Common failure

| Symptom on live site | Cause |
|----------------------|--------|
| `libincai.github.io/grade-3` or `/math-foundations` 404 | Missing `/kiwi-ai-study/` — no site-base on page or stub not deployed |
| `/kiwi-ai-study/<slug>` 404 | Stub folder not generated or not pushed |
| Breadcrumbs / grade picker broken, direct `.html` under `/math/` works | Hub generated without `kiwi-site-base.js` |